    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase 3 P3-03-D: Slab-based buffer pool allocator for ThemisDB. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a thread-safe, fixed-size slab allocator over six size classes (128 B, 256 B, 512 B, 1 KB, 2 KB, 4 KB). Allocations from an appropriate slab class are constant-time and do not call into the OS allocator on the hot path; oversized requests fall back to the system allocator.</para>
<para>Design goals:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&gt;90 % reuse rate (allocated from slab, not from OS)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fragmentation-free fixed-size allocation within each class</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Thread-safe acquire / release via per-class spin-lock + free-list</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Statistics: total allocated, total reused, per-class counts</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Status: Block B P3-03-D delivery </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
